{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is a Twitch-chat interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into a battle warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.poster.avif?t=1766205928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.webm?t=1766205928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.mp4?t=1766205928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your warband:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy minions from the shop, or high-roll them from the slot machine! Train an army of fire-breathing dragons or raise a horde of the undead to destroy your adversaries. Civilly, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/df50598540d6bd65e350b175ac3545f1.avif?t=1766205928\" width=375 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn spells:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells are crucial in turning a battle in your favor. Conjure a fiery Meteor from the heavens, bring down enemy flyers with a deadly Tornado, or melt them down with an Acid Rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/29225942b889c82c45bacb77bf60d563.avif?t=1766205928\" width=199 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn extra rewards when you defeat the bosses. Beware, they are not easy to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/b9e00b0994ee8869e2e675b452ce90ec.avif?t=1766205928\" width=86 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/abcce914912d3a4996285229e55688fb.avif?t=1766205928\" width=86 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into The World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/e6512e919720267a45b344aceb7a39aad0ede269.jpg"},{"name":"Boot Camp Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/d5e32f8160a67f3660587cad3e37cb515d6629d9.jpg"},{"name":"First Cycle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/f80de23ddf341f615a78ebc227a35c0f48a0a8b1.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/ca79866a6bd1715003f72fafa6eac57a40a70f39.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Host","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/34aa51042d624cd69a092a254c8ad57bb02b4149.jpg"},{"name":"100 Damage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/15d278eb649faef4c5bf0d5f872567b451c7412c.jpg"},{"name":"1,000 Damage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/30493336cfbb32597db1a2aa888eb4af86d1370c.jpg"},{"name":"10,000 Damage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/b94766c681918ad5b2d388f7b602e964de352761.jpg"},{"name":"A Formidable Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/5d0e90857607030b18eb2e90e6b0527f5f221802.jpg"},{"name":"A Wrathful Legion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505330/15ee08cced8a751fc864d720540aa514a0a65971.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505330?t=1766205928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505330?t=1766205928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/f79c971c9bcd86c5688b12cdb6258979c31dd55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766205928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/f79c971c9bcd86c5688b12cdb6258979c31dd55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766205928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is a Twitch-chat interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into a battle warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla