 ><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/b9e00b0994ee8869e2e675b452ce90ec.avif?t=1766205928\" width=86 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/abcce914912d3a4996285229e55688fb.avif?t=1766205928\" width=86 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>","developers":["Hyralism"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/f98a7ea9e26b141996f6de228b913e89630318e5/header.jpg?t=1766205928","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3505330/1876586913/ebe115694b25b4410f1f9dffb60b80a0ac9316